      "section": "Local",
      "type": "yesno",
      "title": "Measure Y \u2014 Lassen Union High School Bonds",
      "shortTitle": "Measure Y",
      "rule": "Vote Yes or No",
      "summary": "Authorize $17.5 million in bonds to modernize Lassen Union High School District facilities, repair HVAC systems, improve safety and security, and expand career technical, agriculture, science, and classroom facilities. Estimated average property taxes are $29.55 per $100,000 of assessed value, raising $1.083 million annually while bonds are outstanding, with audits and citizen oversight.",
      "yes": "Authorize the school facilities bonds and property taxes to repay them.",
